emscripten: a domain starts without a signal stack.

Without POSIX signals (no sigaltstack in emscripten, see the recipe),
caml_init_signal_stack returns NULL, which the thread of a new domain takes
for a failure ("Failed to create domain: signal stack").

--- a/runtime/domain.c
+++ b/runtime/domain.c
@@
   void * signal_stack = caml_init_signal_stack();
+#ifndef __EMSCRIPTEN__
   if (signal_stack == NULL) {
     caml_fatal_error("Failed to create domain: signal stack");
   }
+#endif
